    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125780/extras/78c3e2332a1aaae28eb48db38ab440ba.poster.avif?t=1641550116\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125780/extras/78c3e2332a1aaae28eb48db38ab440ba.webm?t=1641550116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125780/extras/78c3e2332a1aaae28eb48db38ab440ba.mp4?t=1641550116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Laufen Und Raufen is a chaotic brawler game for 2-8 players.<br>Take control of your penguin of choice in various game modes and fight your opponents with your almighty flippers!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125780/extras/ae6ff19ca2b7c515be67d6711ec61cfe.poster.avif?t=1641550116\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125780/extras/ae6ff19ca2b7c515be67d6711ec61cfe.webm?t=1641550116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125780/extras/ae6ff19ca2b7c515be67d6711ec61cfe.mp4?t=1641550116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125780/extras/5f70979f2adb6f5f9b452594c859c7c2.avif?t=1641550116\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play with or against your friends with up to 8 players in 2-4 teams!<br></li><li>Show your mighty skills in a competitive brawler game with varied game modes! <br></li><li>Playful and fun gameplay needs a snappy and cool art style \u2013 and we got both covered!<br></li><li>Choose from a variety of different penguin costumes to match your personality!<br></li><li>Push penguins\u2026 into holes! It\u2019s always fun. Especially if you want to spite your friends!<br></li><li>Design your own levels using the built-in level editor. Express your ar(c)tistic side!<br></li><li>Expecting ice, sand or going to the moon? No?! Well, you should! The environments of Laufen Und Raufen are rich and diverse.<br></li><li>Use the game\u2019s easy to pick up controls to reign over your opponents. We know you can do it!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125780/extras/44a196754d5c8cfcca8f18611b2a1347.poster.avif?t=1641550116\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125780/extras/44a196754d5c8cfcca8f18611b2a1347.webm?t=1641550116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125780/extras/44a196754d5c8cfcca8f18611b2a1347.mp4?t=1641550116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125780/extras/ecc6155fcb009b831fb218fbb81ad442.avif?t=1641550116\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fish Fight: Collect all of the fish from your opponents, but beware - the others intend to do the same<br></li><li>Push-ball: Play the aggressive football of the arctic. Score as many goals as possible before the time runs out!<br></li><li>Deathmatch: Take you aggression out on your friends as you push as many of your opponents as possible into holes before the clock strikes zero<br></li><li>Time Attack: You could never get enough fish now can you? Well, prepare your flippering self to collect the most fish before the time ends<br></li><li>All 4 The Fish: What happens when everyone has to fight over one single fish? That's right! An epic battle with flipper action par excellence! So which team could capture the one coveted fish?<br></li><li>Boss: Team up to fight against the biggest penguin or better yet, play as the aforementioned giant penguin and show the puny adversaries who wears the penguin-pants in this house!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125780/extras/5912bab576735d62c0361c9a8fe01cdd.poster.avif?t=1641550116\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125780/extras/5912bab576735d62c0361c9a8fe01cdd.webm?t=1641550116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125780/extras/5912bab576735d62c0361c9a8fe01cdd.mp4?t=1641550116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>However you want to play, if you think the cold never bothered you anyway, then get ready to get your flippers on!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125780/extras/9e84f28bff1f1bcdf6b7fca1c23f5100.poster.avif?t=1641550116\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125780/extras/9e84f28bff1f1bcdf6b7fca1c23f5100.webm?t=1641550116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125780/extras/9e84f28bff1f1bcdf6b7fca1c23f5100.mp4?t=1641550116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
